flowchart TD

    Start([Request created]) --> Draft[Draft]

    Draft -->|Requester submits| PendingReview[Pending Review]

    PendingReview --> Decision{Approver decision}

    Decision -->|Approves| Approved[Approved]
    Decision -->|Rejects with comments| Rejected[Rejected]
    Decision -->|Requests changes| Draft

    Rejected -->|Requester revises and resubmits| PendingReview

    Approved --> EndApproved([End: request proceeds])
    Rejected --> EndRejected([End: request closed])
